1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Hover: no input: the idle — a small bob, pectorals sculling, the anemone swaying

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
U-turn left: Left: the fish turns in an arc (head first, banking) and swims off along its facing

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,300
Cruise across: Right: U-turn back, then burst-and-coast across the tank; release = glide

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,900
Climb facing right: Up alone while facing right: it climbs FORWARD at the 40° pitch limit, then levels on release

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:13,700
Dive facing left: Left (arc), then Down alone: a forward dive at the pitch limit, levelling on release

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,300
Toward the glass: B: turns to face the camera and swims to the glass, easing to a stop before it

7
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,100
Away from the glass: C: turns (toward the centre line, never into the glass) and swims to the back

8
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:25,700
Into the anemone: arrows + B/C toward the crown; camshot B takes over in the zone; it rests level among the swaying tentacles

9
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,200
Wall approach: Right out of the crown to the end wall: it eases to a stop facing the wall (camera back to A)

10
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,350
Turn and dart: Left to turn away from the wall, then an A tap: a dart along the facing, then the glide

11
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:33,850
Hover: no input again: the idle fades back in

